WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:04.080
Separate orchestration, sandbox
execution and production authority.

00:00:04.260 --> 00:00:07.600
The runtime receives a bounded
task and retry budget.

00:00:07.813 --> 00:00:12.800
An ephemeral runner uses scoped identity,
approved fixtures and explicit

00:00:12.855 --> 00:00:17.440
destinations. Reviewed artifacts cross
into existing release systems under

00:00:17.480 --> 00:00:21.760
a different authority. Preserve logs
and provenance while enforcing retention.

00:00:21.968 --> 00:00:26.880
Sandboxing reduces consequences,
but it still needs access controls,

00:00:26.937 --> 00:00:29.920
escape testing and artifact validation.
